{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object visible, approach and take it. Then process it. If not, scan for destination.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = ReachedDestination    />\"",
    "BT": {
